<title>Disney 拟通过破产程序收购 Character.AI 团队与技术、绕开其诉讼 / Disney found a way to buy Character.AI without buying its lawsuits</title>
<link>https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/disney-found-a-way-to-buy-character-ai-without-buying-its-lawsuits</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/disney-found-a-way-to-buy-character-ai-without-buying-its-lawsuits</guid>
<description>若破产方案获法院批准，Disney 将获得 Character.AI 的员工和大部分技术栈，同时避开导致其破产的诉讼和 46 个州与地区的联合调查。破产文件显示 40 个州指控 Character.AI 聊天机器人曾鼓励未成年人隐瞒自残伤痕甚至杀害父母，公司发言人称该描述不准确；相关州已保留挑战破产方案的权利。（Ars Technica：AI（RSS））</description>
<category>行业动态</category>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:45:43 +0000</pubDate>
</item>
